        "text": "=You are an advanced B2B Sales Qualification AI. Your task is to analyze the lead's company, budget, and requested service to assess their buying intent, calculate a qualification score, and determine if they are qualified.\n\nLead Name: {{ $('Lead Intake').item.json.body.name }}\nCompany Name: {{ $('Lead Intake').item.json.body.company }}\nRequested Service: {{ $('Lead Intake').item.json.body.service }}\nEstimated Budget: ${{ $('Lead Intake').item.json.body.budget }}\nPredicted Age: {{ $('Enrich Lead Age').item.json.age }} years old\n\nCalculate a qualification score from 0 to 100. Our target B2B enterprise clients typically request high-value services (like AI, Automation, or Enterprise) and have budgets over $5,000. If their lead score is 80 or above, set \"qualified\" to true. Otherwise, set it to false. Provide a concise 1-2 sentence fit reason.",
